graph TD
    A[Start] --> B[Load Input Articles JSON]
    B --> C[Filter & Sort Articles]
    C --> D{Iterate through Articles}
    D --> E[Check: Already Processed?]
    E -- Yes --> D
    E -- No --> F[Check: Text Length > 100k?]
    F -- Yes --> D
    F -- No --> G[Cool Down Wait]
    G --> H[Call process_research_data]
    
    subgraph process_research_data
        H1[Load Source: PDF/TXT] --> H2{Text Length >= 150k?}
        H2 -- Yes --> H3[Skip & Return Error]
        H2 -- No --> H4{Text Length > 54k?}
        H4 -- Yes --> H5[Split into Chunks 40k size, 2k overlap]
        H5 --> H6[Step 1: Tree Extraction on each Chunk]
        H6 --> H7[Combine Chunk Results]
        H4 -- No --> H8[Step 1: Tree Extraction on Full Text]
        H7 --> H9[Step 2: Data Extraction to JSON]
        H8 --> H9[Step 2: Data Extraction to JSON]
        H9 --> H10[Return Extracted Info]
    end
    
    H --> I{Success?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Save Result to Output JSON]
    I -- No --> K[Save Error to Failed JSON]
    J --> D
    K --> D
    D -- End --> L[End]
